{"title": "India's Private Orbital Rocket Launch Marks Historic Milestone", "summary": "India's private orbital rocket, Vikram-1, successfully launched multiple satellites into space on Saturday, marking a historic milestone for the country's space program. The launch was achieved by Skyroot Aerospace, a Hyderabad-based company that has made India's first commercial rocket designed for orbit.", "summary_points": ["Vikram-1 is a 24-metre-tall, four-stage launch vehicle built primarily using lightweight carbon-composite materials.", "The launch was successful despite some technical challenges faced by the team.", "This achievement marks a significant step forward for India's space program and its private sector players.", "The launch has been hailed as a historic milestone by the government and industry experts alike.", "The success of Vikram-1 is expected to pave the way for more private launches in India."], "title_hi": "भारत का निजी अंतरिक्ष रॉकेट लॉन्च इतिहास का मील खाता है", "summary_hi": "भारत का निजी अंतरिक्ष रॉकेट, विक्रम-1, शनिवार को कई सैटेलाइट्स को अंतरिक्ष में पहुंचाने में सफल रहा, जिससे देश के अंतरिक्ष कार्यक्रम के लिए एक ऐतिहासिक मील खाता हुआ। इस लॉन्च को हैदराबाद स्थित कंपनी स्काईरूट एयरोस्पेस ने सफलतापूर्वक पूरा किया।", "summary_points_hi": ["विक्रम-1 एक 24 मीटर ऊंची, चार चरणों वाला लॉन्च वाहन है, जो मुख्य रूप से हल्के कार्बन-कॉम्पोजिट मैटेरियल्स का उपयोग करके बनाया गया है।", "लॉन्च में कुछ तकनीकी चुनौतियों का सामना करना पड़ा, लेकिन यह सफलतापूर्वक पूरा हुआ।", "यह उपलब्धि भारत के अंतरिक्ष कार्यक्रम और निजी क्षेत्र के खिलाड़ियों के लिए एक महत्वपूर्ण कदम है।", "विक्रम-1 की सफलता से भारत के अंतरिक्ष कार्यक्रम के लिए नए अवसर पैदा होने की उम्मीद है।"], "framing": {"left": "Left-leaning outlets collectively emphasize the significance of this achievement for India's space program and its private sector players, highlighting the potential for more launches in the future.", "right": "Right-leaning outlets frame the story as a historic milestone that marks the beginning of a new era for India's space program, emphasizing the government's support for the private sector."}, "framing_hi": {"left": "विक्रम-1 की सफलता भारत के अंतरिक्ष कार्यक्रम और निजी क्षेत्र के खिलाड़ियों के लिए एक महत्वपूर्ण मील खाता है, जो भविष्य में अधिक लॉन्चेज़ की संभावनाओं को बढ़ावा देता है।", "right": "राइट-लीनिंग आउटलेट्स इसे एक ऐतिहासिक मील के रूप में दर्शाते हैं जो भारत के अंतरिक्ष कार्यक्रम की शुरुआत का संकेत देता है, सरकार के समर्थन को निजी क्षेत्र पर जोर देते हुए।"}, "topic": "International", "region": "India", "image_url": "https://c.ndtvimg.com/2026-07/207hd24s_as_625x300_18_July_26.jpeg", "sources": [{"source": "NDTV", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://www.ndtv.com/india-news/biggest-white-pill-of-all-time-canadian-hails-skyroots-successful-launch-calls-it-indias-new-space-chapter-11789451", "headline": "'Biggest White Pill Of All Time': Canadian Hails Skyroot's Successful Launch, Calls It India's New Space Chapter"}, {"source": "OpIndia", "lean": "right", "language": "en", "url": "https://www.opindia.com/2026/07/skyroot-aerospaces-vikram-1-launch-creates-history-all-you-need-to-know-about-indias-first-privately-developed-orbital-rocket", "headline": "Skyroot Aerospace’s Vikram-1 launch creates history: All you need to know about India’s first privately developed orbital rocket"}, {"source": "Swarajya", "lean": "right", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "India Enters Private Orbital Launch Era As Skyroot’s Vikram-1 Completes Historic Mission From Sriharikota"}, {"source": "Republic World", "lean": "right", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "One Lift Off, Million Possibilities: How India's 1st Private Rocket Vikram 1 By Skyroot Made History"}, {"source": "Amar Ujala", "lean": "center", "language": "hi", "url": "https://www.amarujala.com/video/india-news/skyroot-launched-vikram-1-and-achieved-what-many-major-countries-could-not-2026-07-18", "headline": "SKYROOT कंपन